The advantages of this:
- Don't encourage legacy support;
- Less external symbols, less code to compile-in for !MPC832x_RDB
  platforms.

Signed-off-by: Anton Vorontsov <avorontsov-hkdhdckH98+B+jHODAdFcQ@public.gmane.org>
